Based on the output of Step #1: Implement optimized PostgreSQL modelisation and interactions using SQL, following 3NF (Third Normal Form) unless denormalization is explicitly justified, optimizing for query performance and long-term maintainability, and mitigating risks per OWASP Database Security Cheat Sheet. Write the migrations for the relevant tables, relationships, functions and triggers.
